Good. Let’s move into the actual v1 build contract.

One correction from the earlier specification: I would pin the initial implementation to a stable Jakarta Mail/Angus combination rather than the 2.1.0-M1 milestone that currently appears on Maven Central. Maven Central shows Angus Mail 2.1.0-M1, while stable Angus releases in the 2.0.x line are also available; the exact production pin should be verified at implementation time and locked in the Maven build. 

